msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Access preferred connections from system tray. Enter country or server "
"codes, separated by commas, to quickly connect (e.g.: NL#42, JP, US, IT#01)."
msgstr "从系统托盘访问常用连接。输入国家/地区或服务器代码，以英文逗号分隔，即可快速连接（例如：NL#42, JP, US, IT#01）。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Active port is {new_port}"
msgstr "活动端口为 {new_port}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Allow selected apps to connect without VPN protection."
msgstr "允许选中的应用在无 VPN 保护的情况下连接。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Beta access has been disabled.\n"
"Please restart the app for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"测试版功能已禁用。\n"
"请重启应用以使更改生效。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Beta access has been enabled.\n"
"Please restart the app for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"测试版功能已启用。\n"
"请重启应用以使更改生效。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Bypass firewalls to connect to P2P servers and devices on your local "
"network. "
msgstr "绕过防火墙以连接到 P2P 服务器和本地网络上的设备。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Captures a specific issue you're facing when using Proton VPN to get help from our customer support team.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: This file is a recording of all your internet activity during the capture session."
msgstr ""
"捕获您在使用 Proton VPN 时遇到的特定问题，以便我们的客户支持团队为您提供帮助。\n"
"\n"
"警告：此文件是捕获期间所有互联网活动的记录。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Connect to Proton VPN using your own domain name servers (DNS)."
msgstr "使用您自己的域名服务器 (DNS) 连接到 Proton VPN。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Connect to a Tor server to access hidden services and onion sites using any "
"browser."
msgstr "连接到 Tor 服务器，即可使用任何浏览器访问隐藏服务和 onion 站点。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Connect to your destination server through a second, maximum security VPN "
"server. Slower, but more private."
msgstr "通过第二个最高安全级别的 VPN 服务器连接到您的目标服务器。速度较慢，但更加私密。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Copied!"
msgstr "已复制！"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Crash reports help us fix bugs, detect firewalls, and avoid VPN blocks.\n"
"\n"
"These statistics do not contain your IP address, and they cannot be used to identify you. We'll never share them with third parties."
msgstr ""
"崩溃报告有助于我们修复错误、检测防火墙并避免 VPN 被封锁。\n"
"\n"
"这些统计数据不包含您的 IP 地址，且无法用于识别您的身份。我们绝不会将其分享给第三方。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Customize your connection by deciding which apps are protected by VPN."
msgstr "通过决定哪些应用受 VPN 保护来自定义您的连接。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Disables randomization of the local addresses mapping. This can slightly "
"reduce connection security, but should allow direct connections for online "
"gaming and similar purposes."
msgstr "禁用本地地址映射的随机化。这可能会略微降低连接安全性，但应允许在线游戏及类似用途的直接连接。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Disabling Beta access..."
msgstr "正在禁用测试版功能..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Each code can only be used once"
msgstr "每个恢复码只能使用一次"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Enabling Beta access..."
msgstr "正在启用测试版功能..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Get early access and help us test new versions of Proton VPN."
msgstr "抢先体验，并帮助我们测试 Proton VPN 的新版本。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "If your security key has a button or a gold disc, tap it now."
msgstr "如果您的安全密钥有按钮或金色圆盘，请立即点击它。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Increase your connection speed by up to 400% with performance enhancing "
"technologies."
msgstr "利用性能增强技术，连接速度提升高达 400%！"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Insert the U2F or FIDO key linked to your Proton Account. "
msgstr "请插入与您的 Proton 账户关联的 U2F 或 FIDO 密钥。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "It was not possible to disable Beta access.\n"
msgstr "无法禁用测试版功能！\n"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "It was not possible to enable Beta access.\n"
msgstr "无法启用测试版功能！\n"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Kill switch is blocking any outgoing connections."
msgstr "终止开关正在阻止所有传出连接！"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Kill switch selection is disabled while VPN is active. Disconnect to make "
"changes."
msgstr "VPN 激活时终止开关选择已禁用，请断开连接以进行更改。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Multiple security keys were found. Tap one to select it."
msgstr "检测到多个安全密钥，请点击其中一个以进行选择。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Only selected apps connect with VPN protection. All other traffic is "
"unprotected."
msgstr "仅选中的应用通过 VPN 保护连接，其他所有流量均不受保护。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Permanent Kill Switch is blocking any outgoing connections and preventing your IP to be exposed.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to disable Kill Switch?"
msgstr ""
"永久终止开关正在阻止所有传出连接，并防止您的 IP 地址暴露。\n"
"\n"
"您确定要禁用终止开关吗？"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Please establish a new VPN connection for changes to take effect."
msgstr "请建立新的 VPN 连接以使更改生效。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Protect yourself from ads, malware, and trackers on websites and apps."
msgstr "保护您免受网站和应用中的广告、恶意软件及跟踪器的侵扰。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Protocol can only be changed when VPN is disconnected."
msgstr "仅当 VPN 断开连接时才能更改协议！"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Protocol selection is disabled while VPN is active. Disconnect to make "
"changes."
msgstr "VPN 激活时协议选择已禁用，请断开连接以进行更改。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Quitting the application will cancel the current VPN connection.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"退出应用将取消当前 VPN 连接。\n"
"\n"
"是否继续？"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Quitting the application will keep the kill switch active, but your current VPN connection will be terminated.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"退出应用将保持终止开关启用，但您当前的 VPN 连接将被终止。\n"
"\n"
"是否继续？"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Reporting your issue..."
msgstr "正在报告您的问题..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Signing in..."
msgstr "正在登录..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will cancel the current VPN connection and disable the kill switch.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"登出将取消当前 VPN 连接并禁用终止开关。\n"
"\n"
"是否继续？"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will cancel the current VPN connection.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"登出将取消当前 VPN 连接。\n"
"\n"
"是否继续？"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will disable the kill switch, potentially exposing your internet traffic. \n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"登出将禁用终止开关，这可能会暴露您的互联网流量。\n"
"\n"
"是否继续？"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Signing out..."
msgstr "正在登出..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Split tunneling enabled. Remember to restart affected apps."
msgstr "拆分隧道已启用，请记得重启受影响的应用。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"These servers give the best performance for BitTorrent and file sharing."
msgstr "这些服务器为 BitTorrent 和文件共享提供最佳性能。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"This technology allows Proton VPN to provide higher speed and security in "
"difficult-to-reach countries."
msgstr "这项技术让 Proton VPN 在难以服务的地域更快更安全。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable NetShield."
msgstr "这将禁用 NetShield！"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable custom DNS."
msgstr "这将禁用自定义 DNS。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Tunnels IPv6 traffic through the VPN. Can enhance compatibility with IPv6 "
"networks."
msgstr "通过 VPN 隧道传输 IPv6 流量，可增强与 IPv6 网络的兼容性。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "When enabled, the app starts minimized to the tray."
msgstr "启用后，应用启动时最小化到托盘。"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"You will be connected to a server as soon as Proton VPN app starts. Replace "
"it with a country ISO code (e.g.: US for United States), a server (e.g.: "
"NL#42) or Fastest for quick connection. Default value: Off."
msgstr ""
"Proton VPN 应用启动后，您将立即连接到服务器。可将其替换为国家/地区 ISO 代码（例如：US 代表美国）、服务器（例如：NL#42）或 "
"Fastest 以实现快速连接。默认值：关闭。"

